1
00:00:00,090 --> 00:00:01,320
Which outlives you:

2
00:00:01,320 --> 00:00:02,075
bread,

3
00:00:02,075 --> 00:00:03,028
a banana,

4
00:00:03,028 --> 00:00:04,180
or HONEY?

5
00:00:04,180 --> 00:00:04,900
Honey.

6
00:00:04,930 --> 00:00:06,000
To germs,

7
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:07,633
it's a DESERT.

8
00:00:07,678 --> 00:00:09,055
All that sugar...

9
00:00:09,055 --> 00:00:10,028
SLURPS the water

10
00:00:10,028 --> 00:00:11,076
right out of any germ

11
00:00:11,076 --> 00:00:12,500
that lands in it.

12
00:00:12,550 --> 00:00:13,633
Keep the lid on...

13
00:00:13,679 --> 00:00:14,760
and it can stay good

14
00:00:14,760 --> 00:00:16,440
for CENTURIES.

15
00:00:16,440 --> 00:00:17,287
Way longer

16
00:00:17,287 --> 00:00:18,699
than YOU.

17
00:00:18,869 --> 00:00:19,819
The oldest honey

18
00:00:19,819 --> 00:00:21,400
ever found?

19
00:00:21,460 --> 00:00:23,699
Older than the PYRAMIDS.

20
00:00:23,923 --> 00:00:24,750
Maybe don't eat

21
00:00:24,750 --> 00:00:25,667
THAT one.

